## UI Audit (Brevitas) generated reports -- agent/context.py's own
## EXCLUDED_FROM_DIFF comment explains why these must never be committed:
## a committed report would show up as a changed file on the next run and
## push the agent into auditing everything, forever. .brevitas/config.yml,
## .brevitas/flows/, and .brevitas/baselines/ are real config and ARE
## committed -- only the reports/ output is excluded here.
.brevitas/reports/

